# Stonetalon Mountains - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 confirmed in-band rares and the fixed world
# containers of Stonetalon Mountains. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); the data records no loot on any of these nine
# rares, so there are no signature drops to chase and no tame lines ship
# either (no loot evidence, no core-guide corroboration — see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. The Barrow Cache and the Talon Den Hoard belong to
# Stranglethorn's Pebble of Kajaro quests and are not covered here. No rare in
# this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest. See
# docs/stonetalon-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stonetalon-rares
title Stonetalon Mountains - Rares & Treasures
levels 16-30
zone Stonetalon Mountains
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords stonetalon, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Pridewing Patriarch — the center

  loop
  goto 47.75,46.75
  goto 53.79,36.31
  kill 4015 optional
  note Level 25 rare, flagged rare in the data, working the center.
  note The data records no loot on this rare at all; respawn timer unconfirmed.

